# Local secrets for the cron worker (`wrangler dev --config
# workers/cron/wrangler.toml`). Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in.
# Production values are set with `wrangler secret put <NAME> --config
# workers/cron/wrangler.toml` (S10).

# Twelve Data free-tier API key (https://twelvedata.com/) — stocks refresh
# logs a clean failure without it; everything else runs fine.
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=""

# Contact surfaced in the scraper User-Agent: "Osooly/1.0 (+<this>)".
# An email or URL someone can actually reach the operators at.
SCRAPER_CONTACT="osooly.app"

# Optional: extra comma-separated stock symbols to track platform-wide
# (the cron always includes TASI plus symbols users hold).
# STOCK_SYMBOLS="SPX,IXIC"

# Optional: exchangerate.host access key for the USD->SAR rate. Without it
# the gold job uses the keyless open.er-api.com daily feed (PRD §3.10).
# EXCHANGERATE_ACCESS_KEY=""

# Optional: override the REGA open-data dataset URL if the portal moves it.
# REGA_INDEX_URL=""
